# Third-party notices

This project evaluates public AI-image detectors and uses public image corpora.
No third-party weights or source images are redistributed in this repository.

## Datasets (identifiers and licences only)

- **COCO** (COCO 2017 validation subset, images used as "real" content).
  Licence: CC BY 4.0 (annotations) / Flickr terms per image. https://cocodataset.org
- **ELSA1M** (AI-generated subset used as "AI" content).
  Licence: research use, see the dataset card. https://huggingface.co/datasets/elsaEU/ELSA1M

Per-image source IDs and licence fields are recorded in
`manifests/EXAM02/run_*/sources.parquet`; a SHA-256 of each source file is in the
same table (`original_file_sha256`).

## Models (evaluated, not redistributed)

| key | checkpoint | revision |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `swinv2_deploy` | `Organika/sdxl-detector` (SwinV2) | pinned in `models/registry.json` |
| `siglip_ai_human` | SigLIP-based detector | pinned |
| `swin_sdxl` | SDXL-detector variant | pinned |
| `convnext_ai` | ConvNeXt detector | pinned |
| `resnet_ai` | `mmanikanta/ResNet_AI_image_detector` | pinned |
| `vit_ai_real` | `Cyberdon360/ai-vs-real-image-detector` | pinned |

Exact commit hashes and file hashes are recorded in `manifests/EXAM01/*` and
`models/registry.json`; each model's declared `id2label` mapping is quoted in
`ops/decisions/DEC-0011_orientation_convention.md`.

